{"name":"Shay Luuq (Saber-Deer)","size":"large","type":"Mosntrosity","tag":"","alignment":"unaligned","hitDice":"7","armorName":"natural armor","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":4,"otherArmorDesc":"15 (natural armor)","speed":"40","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"52 (7d10 + 14)","speedDesc":"40 ft.","strPoints":"15","dexPoints":"13","conPoints":"15","intPoints":"1","wisPoints":"9","chaPoints":"3","blindsight":"60","blind":false,"darkvision":"0","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"3","customCr":"3 (700 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The giant scorpion can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The giant scorpion regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the giant scorpion can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the giant scorpion can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The giant scorpion can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the giant scorpion's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the giant scorpion's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the giant scorpion dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[],"actions":[{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"The scorpion makes three attacks: two with its claws and one with its sting."},{"name":"Claw","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. _Hit:_ [STR 1d8] bludgeoning damage, and the target is grappled (escape DC 12). The [MON] can only have one creature grappled at a time."},{"name":"Sting","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 5 ft., one creature. _Hit:_ [STR 1d10] piercing damage, and the target must make a DC 12 Constitution saving throw, taking [4d8] poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[],"skills":[],"damagetypes":[],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[],"languages":[],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"deer","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":false,"separationPoint":1,"damage":[]}